{"suttaId":"tha-ap232","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7952,7969],"vripara":"48"},"segments":{"tha-ap232:0.3":"Ekavandaniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap232:1.1":"“Usabhaṃ pavaraṃ vīraṃ, vessabhuṃ vijitāvinaṃ;","tha-ap232:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, buddhaseṭṭhamavandahaṃ.","tha-ap232:2.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap232:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, vandanāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap232:3.1":"“Catuvīsatikappamhi, vikatānandanāmako;","tha-ap232:3.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap232:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap232:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekavandaniyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap232:6.1":"Ekavandaniyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap232:7.1":"Ālambaṇadāyakavaggo tevīsatimo.","tha-ap232:8.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap232:9.1":"Ālambaṇañca ajinaṃ, maṃsadārakkhadāyako;","tha-ap232:9.3":"Abyādhi aṅkolaṃ [vakulaṃ (syā.), bakuḷaṃ (ka.)] soṇṇaṃ, miñjaāveḷavandanaṃ;","tha-ap232:9.5":"Pañcapaññāsa gāthāyo, gaṇitā atthadassibhi."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
